              "changes": [
                "Source diff of the 0.4.1 and 0.4.2 sdists, downloaded and hashed on the Mac, nothing installed or run: README, __init__, models.py, sandbox.py, one test changed; tests/test_checkpoints.py added.",
                "Adds filesystem checkpoints: SandboxCheckpoint, CheckpointLookupError and BatchCheckpointResponse models; checkpoint, get_checkpoint, get_checkpoints (batch of up to 100 ids), wait_for_checkpoint and list_checkpoints on the sync and async clients; CreateSandboxRequest takes checkpoint_id with a validate_restore_source check.",
                "CreateSandboxRequest.docker_image becomes Optional (None when restoring from a checkpoint) and disk_size_gb's default 5.0 becomes None.",
                "Background job launch: the working_dir prefix is 'cd DIR || exit 1;' instead of 'cd DIR &&', and the launch cwd is / for an absolute working_dir.",
                "No existing method was removed or renamed. Installed consumer qualification against withruntime/prime is not run; the supported pin stays 0.4.1."
              ]
            }
          }
        }
